	(text "FORMULA: C_OUT = 100/(V_OUT/f_sw), ΔV_OUT ≈ ΔI_L / (8 × f_SW × C_OUT)\nDATA: V_OUT = 5V, f_Sw = 2, ΔI_L = 0.38A(inductor ripple current)\nRESOLUTION: C_OUT = 100 / (5 × 2)\nC_OUT = 10 µF (at minimum)\nΔV_OUT ≈ 0,38 A / (8 × 2 MHz × 22 µF)\nΔV_OUT ≈ 1,1 mV"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.216 84.582 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "461339f9-a260-435a-bfbe-22c97b3370ee")
	)
	(text "FORMULA: C1 >> C2,   Z0 = √(L_cable / C2)   \nDATA: L_cable = 1 µH, C2 = 4.7 µF, V_TVS(clamp) = 29.2 V\nRESOLUTION: C1 ≥ 4 × 4.7 µF = 19 µF\n              Z0 = sqrt(1 µH / 4.7 µF) ≈ 0.46 Ω \n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36.576 75.438 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cff2c0ea-d54c-4446-9872-d4052c664e15")
	)
	(text "The chosen switching frequency is 2 MHz:\nit is below the maximum frequency allowed by the buck converter and above the AM radio band.\n\nThe inductor was chosen according to the datasheet reference design (4.7 µH).\n\nFORMULA:\nripple = V_OUT / (L × f_SW) × (1 − V_OUT / V_IN(MAX))   (datasheet p. 14)\nCapacitor charging: I_C = C × V / t\nI_PEAK = I_C + I_LOAD + ripple / 2\n\nDATA:\nV_OUT = 5 V, V_IN(MAX) = 17 V, L = 4.7 µH, f_SW = 2 MHz, I_LOAD = 45 mA, \nC = 35 µF (total capacitance on the 5 V rail), t = 3.9 ms (soft-start time, datasheet p. 16)\nRESOLUTION:\nripple = 5 V / (4.7 µH × 2 MHz) × (1 − 5 V / 17 V)\n       = 0.53 A × 0.71\n       ≈ 0.38 A\n\nI_C = 35 µF × 5 V / 3.9 ms\n    ≈ 0.05 A\n\nI_PEAK = 0.05 A + 0.045 A + 0.38 A / 2\n       = 0.05 A + 0.045 A + 0.19 A\n       ≈ 0.30 A\n\nThe feedback resistors were chosen according to the datasheet reference design\n(R2 = 1 MΩ, R3 = 187 kΩ).\n\nFORMULA:\nV_OUT = V_FB × (R2 + R3) / R3   (datasheet p. 13)\n\nDATA:\nV_FB = 0.778 V (internal reference, datasheet)\nR2 = 1 MΩ, R3 = 187 kΩ\n\nRESOLUTION:\nV_OUT = 0.778 V × (1 MΩ + 187 kΩ) / 187 kΩ ≈ 4.94 V\n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.568 118.364 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e337f08c-4851-4740-8747-92aab8df3724")
	)
